# Dependency Reports

Generated by: make code-deptry, make ci

## Output Files

| File        | Description                       |
|-------------|-----------------------------------|
| deptry.json | Dependency hygiene scan results   |

## Configuration

File: pyproject.toml

| Section                       | Purpose                            |
|-------------------------------|------------------------------------|
| [tool.deptry]                 | Excludes, first-party modules      |
| [tool.deptry.per_rule_ignores]| Package-specific rule exceptions   |

Key settings:
- extend_exclude: directories to skip
- known_first_party: project modules
- json_output: report path
